 <div class="section card intel-card"><div class="intel-head"><div><h2>Customer detail</h2><p>Select a customer above to inspect their feedback and linked problems.</p></div></div><div id="customerDetail"><div class="empty">Select a customer to inspect their experience history.</div></div></div>
</section>

<section id="features" class="view">
 <div class="page-head"><div><h1>Product & feature intelligence</h1><p>See which product areas are generating customer pain, which features are rising in risk, and where to investigate next.</p></div><div class="toolbar"><button class="btn" onclick="classifyFeatures()">Classify feedback</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="loadFeatures()">Refresh intelligence</button></div></div>
