 <div class="twocol section"><div class="card intel-card"><div class="intel-head"><div><h2>Feature detail</h2><p>Select a feature to inspect feedback, customers, and linked problems.</p></div></div><div id="featureDetail"><div class="empty">Select a feature above.</div></div></div><div class="card intel-card"><div class="intel-head"><div><h2>Product areas</h2><p>Where customer pain is concentrated.</p></div></div><div id="productAreas"><div class="empty">Loading…</div></div></div></div>
</section>


<section id="teams" class="view">
