  <div class="card intel-card"><div class="intel-head"><div><h2>Active rules</h2><p>Governed rules used by the automation engine.</p></div></div><div id="automationRules"><div class="empty">Loading…</div></div></div>
 </div>
 <div class="section card intel-card"><div class="intel-head"><div><h2>Automation runs</h2><p>Recent evaluations and generated review items.</p></div></div><div id="automationRuns"><div class="empty">Loading…</div></div></div>
</section>


<section id="executive" class="view">
