</section>


<section id="os" class="view">
 <div class="page-head"><div><h1>FeedbackOS Operating System</h1><p>One governed loop connecting customer signals, problems, risk, teams, actions, outcomes, strategy, and executive decisions.</p></div><div class="toolbar"><button class="btn primary" onclick="runOSLoop()">Run operating loop</button><button class="btn" onclick="saveOSSnapshot()">Save snapshot</button><button class="btn" onclick="loadOS()">Refresh</button></div></div>
 <div class="grid4">
